    "enUS": {
      "description": "Alright dirtwalker, you may have noticed the combination of pinecones and fel-infused slime is quite disgusting, if you ask me. It is, however, also very dangerous-- which is just what we need!\r\n\r\nTake these pinecones and carefully--I repeat, carefully--make your way to the nearby warlock encampment. Once there, use these items to wreak havoc upon their precious workstations.\r\n\r\nI am sure the results will be amusing for you to watch firsthand! This should certainly slow them down.",
